OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle
OL,4,A'heart-breaking' fire at bike factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 30 firefighters have tackled a
OL,7,Fblaze at a bike factory which has left
OL,8,Fthe owners "heartbroken".
OL,10,FCrews were called to Atherton Bikes at
OL,11,FTreowain business park in Machynlleth,
OL,12,FPowys on Sunday at 08:00 BST.
OL,14,FA plume of grey smoke was seen over the
OL,15,Ftown with residents advised to keep
OL,16,Fdoors and windows closed.
OL,18,FWorld champion mountain bikers Gee and
OL,19,FRachel Atherton said they were
OL,20,F"devastated" for their staff and
OL,21,Fcustomers.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
